{"version":1,"content":"<p>加拿大高級羽絨服品牌「加拿大鵝」（Canada Goose）合作攝製團隊近日被指在浙江寧波山區遺留大批垃圾，引發內地輿論批評。</p><p>品牌方昨晚（12日）致歉，稱攝製團隊已返回現場全面清理，並展開「淨山行動」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:07.405624+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T09:17:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723777+00:00","content_hash":"d0b35cce8a789dab830f29d03ce397145df19187b6314bc78dea289623ae27b0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}